&lt;p&gt;I've spent a surprising amount of my career building admin portals.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There were four of them in total: two at Accumulus and two at Restful Mind. In both cases, the “two” came from rebuilding a portal with a new stack.&lt;/p&gt;

